label Cable
if {cable} == true:
	cable: What are you waiting for?
else:
	cable: You have work to do. You're already 3 months in.
	[signal arg="respond"]
[end_timeline]
label Cable_response
if {response} == "right":
	cable: Good.
elif {response} == "neutral":
	cable: You are a magnetbot. We work hard and earn our keep. Don't forget.
else:
	cable: What kind of magnet bot would have claws? you want to be clawbot that bad? I'm sure there's another network out there to take you.
	diode: Cable! Green's been doing this for three months. It knows what it's doing.
	set {cable} = true
[end_timeline]
label Siren
if {siren} == true:
	siren: asfva
else:
	siren: I know you don't like your job.
	[signal arg="respond"]
[end_timeline]
label Siren_response
if {response} == "right":
	green: slnas
elif {response} == "neutral":
	<Empty Text Event>
else:
	<Empty Text Event>
set {siren} = true
[end_timeline]
label Diode
if {diode} == true:
	diode: I'll catch up later! Just need Cable to blow off steam.
else:
	[signal arg="respond"]
[end_timeline]
label Diode_response
if {response} == "right":
	green: I'll see you after work?
	diode: you know it! glad to see you giving this a try! again.
elif {response} == "neutral":
	green: I don't think I can join you today. My magnets are gonna need a break after today.
	Don't worry about it. We can just charge in early and look at the constellations on the other side of the ship.
else:
	green: Can't do today. Sorry.
	diode: Oh. I thought you might want to stick around longer. But that's okay!
diode: Here's a thing I found. Hijo would've wanted you to have it.
set {diode} = true
[signal arg="clock"]
[end_timeline]
label PhotoFrame
Who are these people?
[end_timeline]
label Mirror
...
[end_timeline]
label Dried Flower
No one knows how it got here but everyone thinks it might've been one of our humans before they passed.
[end_timeline]
label Scrap Pile
All your parts came from that pile of scrap. Siren said this room used to be packed to the ceiling with our netmates. This is all that's left.
[end_timeline]
label Horse Toy
The paint's long gone but it can't really be recycled into anything. I got Trak to help me carry it back.
[end_timeline]